{"articleNo":"726","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=726&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"▦2009-1대학원(산업및교육)졸업종합시험 안내▦","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.03.27","hit":"17820","attachments":[{"name":"응시원서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=726&attachNo=69442"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; WIDTH: 427px; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; HEIGHT: 42px\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"443\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"33\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><font size=\"3\">2009-1 대학원(산업 및 교육)&nbsp;졸업종합시험 안내</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;2009학년도 1학기 대학원(산업,교육대학원) 졸업종합시험과 관련하여 안내드리오니</p>\n<p>정해진 일정에 맞춰 응시원서(사진1매 첨부)를 해당 학과(전공) 종합학사행정실에 제출하시기 바랍니다.<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">1. 졸업종합시험 일정표</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium non