       <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"65\" height=\"23\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">사진(3*4)1매 첨부</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"131\" height=\"31\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">졸업종합시험일</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"199\" height=\"31\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><font color=\"#1e90ff\">2009. 4. 17(금)</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"183\" height=\"31\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;각 학과별 지정된 장소</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"65\" height=\"31\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"131\" height=\"31\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">시험결과 발표</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"199\" height=\"31\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2009. 4. 27(월)</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"183\" height=\"31\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">원스톱서비스 조회</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp; <u>☞ 경로 :로그인/학적</u></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><u>자료조회/종합시험 </u></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"65\" height=\"31\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2. 졸업종합시험 시행 세부사항 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 주관 : 각 학과 주임교수 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 응시자격 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">대학원, 산업대학원, 교육대학원</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"> : 3학기 이상 등록, &nbsp;지도교수의 추천 &nbsp;받은 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">교육대학원 무논문 석사과정 신청자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"> : 5학기 이상 등록, 지도교수의 추천 받은 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3)&nbsp;<strong><u>산업대학원 무논문석사과정 신청자</u></strong> :&nbsp; 6학기 이상 등록, 지도교수의 추천 받은 자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 시험과목 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;⑴ 석사과정 : 주임교수가 지정하는 3과목 이상</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;⑵ 박사과정 : 주임교수가 지정하는 4과목 이상</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#8b008b\">※ 졸업종합시험 응시과목은 학차에 따라 한과목씩 따로 응시할 수 없으며, </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><font color=\"#8b008b\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;석사 3과목 이상․박사 4과목 이상 해당과목을 일괄적으로 응시하여야 함</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#1e90ff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (단, 응시과목 중 불합격한 과목에 대해서는 한과목 응시 가능)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp; 라. 합격기준 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;⒧ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">대학원, 산업대학원 및 교육대학원 논문 석사과정</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;과목당 100점 만점에 석사과정은 60점 이상, 박사과정은 70점 이상인 경우</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;합격으로 인정하며 과목별 합격도 인정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">⑵ <strong>산업 및 </strong></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">교육대학원의 무논문 석사과정 신청자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">과목당 100점 만점에 70점 이상인 경우 합격으로 인정하며 과목별 합격도 인정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><font color=\"#000000\">3. 문의처 :&nbsp; 각 학과(전공) 종합학사행정실</font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span>\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"113\" bgcolor=\"#ffff99\" height=\"32\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">행정실 명</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"87\" bgcolor=\"#ffff99\" height=\"32\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">과 정 명</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(0,0,0) 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"283\" bgcolor=\"